---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Home">
  <section>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">
      Hi, I'm Valentine.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">
      I've spent 7+ years building data-driven products, grounded in software engineering and AI
      research. Started at 17 as an ML data annotator, launched products from 0→1, scaled teams
      and growth. Generalist across engineering, research, product, and data.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">
      Most interested in: social media and psychological health, AI's impact on work and labor,
      and healthy AI-human relationships. Increasingly focused on AI safety and governance —
      spanning technical robustness, geopolitical stakes, and human impact.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">
      Based in Philadelphia, looking for my next role.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-6 flex gap-4 text-sm">
      <a
        href="/experience"
        class="rounded-md bg-neutral-900 px-4 py-2 font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-700 dark:bg-neutral-100 dark:text-neutral-900 dark:hover:bg-neutral-300"
      >
        See my experience
      </a>
      <a
        href="/projects"
        class="rounded-md border border-neutral-300 px-4 py-2 font-medium text-neutral-700 transition-colors hover:border-neutral-400 dark:border-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:hover:border-neutral-600"
      >
        See my projects
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
